Scenario: Attempt to download DXP aggregate licenses with two 70 and one 71 versions cant aggregate error
	Testing the attempt to download two 7.0 and one 7.1 generated and aggregated active licenses cant aggregate error for a T4 DXP project from koroneiki on provisioning

	Given I generate a provisioning project name
	And I create an account on koroneiki with the following values
	| Code                  | KORLICKORLIC                         | |
	| Contact Email Address | lic.koroneiki1@lrcustomer.com.broken | |
